usage-grok-setting-token = SuperGrok Bearer 令牌，仅当所选主机上的 Grok CLI 未登录时需要（能在那里运行 `grok login` 时请优先使用）。它是 ~/.grok/auth.json 中 https://auth.x.ai 条目的 "key"。xai- API 密钥无效。

usage-grok-credits = 额度
usage-grok-prepaid-balance = 预付余额
usage-grok-included-credits = 套餐内额度
usage-grok-not-reported = 未报告
usage-grok-period-ends = 周期结束
